       <h1>Actor Shanaya Kapoor Celebrates Birthday With Notable Fashion Highlights</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Actor Shanaya Kapoor, currently starring in the upcoming series Student of the Year: After Dark, is being recognized for her distinct fashion sense on her birthday. Her style portfolio features a variety of experimental looks, ranging from a punk-inspired leather ensemble by Mark Gong to a contemporary, geometric-embellished saree designed by Ritika Mirchandani for Lakmé Fashion Week.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-02/actor-shanaya-kapoor-celebrates-birthday-with-notable-fashio.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Kapoor’s fashion choices often align with her project promotions, such as the school-inspired pinstriped blazer and shorts ensemble worn for her latest series launch. Other notable appearances include a forest-green latex mini dress and a sculptural ivory one-shoulder gown by Meraki Official, showcasing her versatility in statement-making silhouettes.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Captures the essence of the fashion review while maintaining the requested brevity.</p>
