     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-11-02 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Compound wall collapses at Nellore women's college</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>A compound wall at the 40-year-old Government Polytechnic College for Women in Nellore collapsed on Monday due to heavy rainfall from Cyclone Murasu. A falling tree exacerbated the structural failure, damaging nearby parked cars, though no injuries were reported among students or staff.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-11-02/compound-wall-collapses-at-nellore-womens-college.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Parents have repeatedly requested renovations for the college and hostel buildings, citing their dilapidated and unsafe condition. Despite these warnings, the A.P. Department of Technical Education has failed to act, citing a lack of budget. Local parents are now urging the government to prioritize the construction of a new facility to ensure student safety.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is concise, accurate, and includes all relevant details including the specific location and the context of the parents' prior warnings.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/andhra-pradesh/compound-wall-at-government-polytechnic-college-for-women-in-nellore-collapses/article71657527.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/nellore/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nellore</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
